                    <h1 class=" heading-component__headline t-overline-normal ">
                        Craving for food?</h1>
                    <h2 class="heading-component__title  t-title-m ">
                        Dining</h2>
                    
                    <p class=" heading-component__description t-font-s " data-threshold="400" data-ellipsis-type="seemore" data-seemore-text="See More" data-seeless-text="See Less">
                        Take a Bite. Head to YEN Chinese Restaurant on the 31st floor for upscale nouvelle Cantonese delicacies. Have a Sip. Wind down with an innovative cocktail at Living Room. An extensive drink list awaits at WOOBAR, our cocktail bar in Xinyi, Taipei, where you can light up the night after dark. Hang out at WET® Bar, our poolside oasis with refreshing sips, light bites and al fresco dining du jour from an outdoor urban barbeque. For sensual, atmospheric evenings, YEN Bar offers imaginative Asian tapas and a sophisticated setting with stunning views of the Taipei skyline. Stay in. Just because you&#39;re cozy in your room doesn&#39;t mean you can&#39;t indulge. Our 24-hour in-room dining service features popular menu items from our hotel restaurants. Epicurean offerings are a buzz away.
                    </p>
                    
                    

    
    
